# Do not stop for progress updates

Keep implementing the full Playwright Haskell API and official test suite until that work is complete.

Stop only to ask a concrete question or for guidance. Do not pause to narrate progress, recap batches, or wait for confirmation.

After a green commit-sized batch, commit (DESIGN.md allows this) and immediately start the next batch.

Read `DESIGN.md` and follow it. Do not add artificial test delays unless the official Playwright test has the same wait.
